  "description": "Classic Christmas Tartan Plaid is a sophisticated seamless digital paper collection inspired by traditional Scottish tartan, cozy Christmas textiles, and timeless holiday décor. The collection features rich woven-style plaid patterns in classic combinations of deep red, forest green, cream, burgundy, black, and warm neutral tones.\nFeaturing a variety of tartan checks, diagonal plaid arrangements, layered stripes, traditional woven textures, and elegant Christmas color combinations, this collection is perfect for creating cozy and timeless holiday designs.\nFeatures:\n• 26 Seamless Digital Paper Designs\n• Classic Christmas Tartan Plaid Theme\n• Traditional Scottish-Inspired Plaid Aesthetic\n• JPG Format\n• 300 DPI High Resolution\n• Seamless Repeating Patterns\n• Red & Green Tartan Patterns\n• Burgundy Plaid Designs\n• Forest Green & Cream Checks\n• Traditional Christmas Plaid\n• Diagonal Tartan Patterns\n• Layered Stripe & Check Designs\n• Woven Textile-Inspired Appearance\n• Rich Red, Green, Cream & Burgundy Palette\n• Cozy Rustic Christmas Style\nPerfect for scrapbooking, Christmas cards, invitations, gift wrapping, stationery, planners, journals, printable crafts, fabric projects, holiday packaging, backgrounds, home décor projects, and other seasonal creative designs.\nAdd a warm, traditional, rustic Christmas feeling to your projects with this versatile collection of classic tartan and plaid patterns.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Classic Christmas Tartan Plaid is a sophisticated seamless digital paper collection inspired by traditional Scottish tartan, cozy Christmas textiles, and timeless holiday décor. The collection features rich woven-style plaid patterns in classic combinations of deep red, forest green, cream, burgundy, black, and warm neutral tones.</p>\n<p>Featuring a variety of tartan checks, diagonal plaid arrangements, layered stripes, traditional woven textures, and elegant Christmas color combinations, this collection is perfect for creating cozy and timeless holiday designs.</p>\n<p>Features:<br>\n• 26 Seamless Digital Paper Designs<br>\n• Classic Christmas Tartan Plaid Theme<br>\n• Traditional Scottish-Inspired Plaid Aesthetic<br>\n• JPG Format<br>\n• 300 DPI High Resolution<br>\n• Seamless Repeating Patterns<br>\n• Red &amp; Green Tartan Patterns<br>\n• Burgundy Plaid Designs<br>\n• Forest Green &amp; Cream Checks<br>\n• Traditional Christmas Plaid<br>\n• Diagonal Tartan Patterns<br>\n• Layered Stripe &amp; Check Designs<br>\n• Woven Textile-Inspired Appearance<br>\n• Rich Red, Green, Cream &amp; Burgundy Palette<br>\n• Cozy Rustic Christmas Style</p>\n<p>Perfect for scrapbooking, Christmas cards, invitations, gift wrapping, stationery, planners, journals, printable crafts, fabric projects, holiday packaging, backgrounds, home décor projects, and other seasonal creative designs.</p>\n<p>Add a warm, traditional, rustic Christmas feeling to your projects with this versatile collection of classic tartan and plaid patterns.</p>",
